{title: Thoda Thoda Pyaar}
{artist: Stebin Ben Nilesh Ahuja}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm]Teri Nazar Ne Yeh [Cm]Kya Kar [C#]Diya,        [Fm]Mujhse Hi Mujhko [Cm]Juda Kar [C#]Diya
[Fm]Teri Nazar Ne Yeh [Cm]Kya Kar [C#]Diya,        [Fm]Mujhse Hi Mujhko [Cm]Juda Kar [C#]Diya
Main [G#]Rehta Hoon Tere [D#]Paas Kahin,        Ab [C#]Mujhko Mera [D#]Ehsaas Nahi
Dil [Fm]Kehta Hai Kasam se?        Ke Thoda Thoda [C#]Pyaar Hua Tum [D#]se
Ke Thoda [C#]Ikraar Hua Tum [D#]se,        Ke Thoda Thoda [C#]Pyaar Hua Tum [D#]se
Ke Thoda [C#]Ikraar Hua Tum [D#]se,        Ke Zyada Bhi [G#]Hoga Tumhi [D#]Se
Ke Thoda Thoda [C#]Pyaar Hua Tum [D#]se,        Meri [G#]Aankhon Ki Dua Hai
Yeh [D#]Chehra Tera,        Ab [C#]Dekhe Bin Tujhe
Na [D#]Guzara Ho [Fm]Mera,        Meri [G#]Aankhon Ki Dua Hai
Yeh [D#]Chehra Tera Ab [C#]Dekhe Bin,        Tujhe Na [D#]Guzara Ho [Fm]Mera
Main [C#]Saans Bhi Loon,        Tujhe [D#]Chahe Bina
Ab [Fm]Hoga Na Yeh Hum [Cm]se,        Ke Thoda Thoda [C#]Pyaar Hua Tum [D#]se
Ke Thoda [C#]Ikraar Hua Tum [D#]se,        Ke Thoda Thoda [C#]Pyaar Hua Tum [D#]se
Ke Thoda [C#]Ikraar Hua Tum [D#]se,        Ke Zyada Bhi [G#]Hoga Tumhi [D#]Se
Ke Thoda Thoda [C#]Pyaar Hua Tum [D#]se
